  "system": {
    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p>The bullet goes in through your open mouth. It lacerates your tongue and soft palate before it exits behind the angle of your jaw in a spray of spittle and blood.</p><p><strong>Effects:</strong> Gain @Condition[Stunned] (3) and @Condition[Bleeding] (1). For healing purposes count it as a @UUID[Compendium.wfrp4e-core.items.Item.hCadFsTRvLN9faaY]{Broken Bone (Major)} except long-term effects are automatic as you’ll never be able to speak properly again. </p><p>No Extraction is necessary.</p>"
    },
